&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Clear Street&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Clear Street’s mission is to give every sophisticated investor access to every asset, in every market, through a unified platform built for speed, transparency and scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;We give our clients the technology, tools, and service once reserved for the largest institutions, rebuilt with modern infrastructure. Our single, cloud-native, end-to-end capital markets platform powers investor growth today and is transforming how they can interact with markets tomorrow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href="https://clearstreet.io/"&gt;https://clearstreet.io&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;As a Software Engineer on Clear Street’s Payments team, you’ll play a key role in scaling and modernising our rapidly evolving global payments infrastructure. You’ll develop highly reliable, API-driven systems that integrate seamlessly with external banks and payment gateways, streamlining complex operational workflows and supporting our expansion into new lines of business, including digital initiatives. Working closely with cross-functional partners, you’ll contribute to large-scale, high-impact initiatives that enhance our core payments offering, significantly reduce manual operational processes, and offer our customers a smooth payment experience, helping to shape the future of the Clear Street financial ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Engineer highly reliable, API-driven payment systems that streamline operations and support our global expansion.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Translate product and design requirements into clean, maintainable and well-tested components.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Collaborate closely with product managers, business, operations, designers and back-end engineers to deliver high-quality experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Identify and resolve performance, accessibility, and usability issues across the application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Participate in code reviews, contribute to shared component libraries, and help uphold our engineering standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Support the operational health of your features and help maintain a high SLA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;You will work with a team of talented, passionate and highly collaborative engineers. Working together, we have built a platform that serves institutional clients and is at the forefront of technological innovation. Our engineers take pride in not just the value we provide our customers but the quality of our work. You will have the opportunity to work with cutting-edge technologies, collaborate with colleagues from diverse backgrounds, and make a meaningful impact on the financial industry. We value creativity, innovation, strong work ethics, and we are committed to providing our team members with the support and resources they need to succeed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Java Spring Boot, Kafka, gRPC/REST, Kubernetes and Cloud (AWS or Azure).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Master Java and Spring Boot, and comfortably make tweaks in TypeScript/React, Go, and Python.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;A proven track record of driving technical decisions and owning complex, large-scale engineering problems end-to-end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Hands-on experience building scalable architectures utilizing Kafka and Kubernetes for robust, resilient integrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Solid understanding of global payment ecosystems, external banking APIs, and streamlining complex operational workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Strong command of software design patterns, distributed systems, clean code principles, and automated testing strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Ability to actively manage technical debt, negotiate requirements, and ship reliable solutions without demanding perfection.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Actively advocate for better tooling, overhaul inefficient processes, and push our engineering practices forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;A highly collaborative mindset with a preference for collectively solving intricate architectural challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;"Don't meet every single requirement? Apply anyway! We are looking for strong engineers with a growth mindset, not perfect resumes. If this role excites you, we want to hear from you."&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;At Clear Street, we offer competitive compensation packages, company equity, pension, gender-neutral parental leave, and full medical and dental insurance. Our belief has always been that we are better as a business when we are all together in person. As such, we require employees to be in the office a minimum of three days per week.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12pt;"&gt;Our top priority is our people. We’re continuously investing in a culture that promotes collaboration. We help each other through challenges and celebrate each other’s successes. We believe that modern workplaces succeed by virtue of having high-performance workforces that are diverse in ideas, in cultures, and in experiences. We put in the effort to make such a workplace a daily reality and are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>
